# Split second (CR 702.61a): while Krosan Grip is on the stack no spell may be cast, by a resolving ability either (Krosan
# Grip's ruling: "If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can't be cast if a spell
# with split second is on the stack"). Triggered abilities still trigger (CR 702.61b). Turn 5: Bot1 casts Krosan Grip at
# Bot2's Mox Pearl; Dragon's Rage Channeler's "whenever you cast a noncreature spell, surveil 1" goes above it, keeps
# Ornithopter on top, and the surveil triggers Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong above the Grip. It looks at the Ornithopter but
# may not cast it: Bot1 is asked nothing. Once the Grip has resolved (the control), the Planetarium's own scry triggers it
# again - nothing was cast with it this turn - and Bot1 casts the Ornithopter without paying its mana cost.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong
Mox Ruby
Dragon's Rage Channeler
Krosan Grip
Ornithopter
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dragon's Rage Channeler.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Krosan Grip.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Ornithopter |)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
? Stack = Krosan Grip
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Ornithopter; Island |)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
